    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/18d855f4e20e1a9d8a63bfe67b422c8a.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Mile</strong> is a gripping, story-driven action adventure where you step into the shoes of <strong>Nick Rieger</strong>, a man on the run from a dark past and relentless justice. But this is not just a tale of escape \u2013 it\u2019s a test of who you become when everything else is stripped away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending a cinematic narrative with dynamic world progression, <i>The Last Mile</i> challenges players to navigate branching paths, shifting situations, and optional side quests based on their decisions.<br><strong>Same story \u2013 different journey.</strong> Every choice affects who you meet, what you experience, and how far you\u2019re willing to go to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/8452d5e53d2e3c3f8efe39e401d4d814.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Mile</i> explores themes of emotion, betrayal, humanity, and moral conflict. Follow Nick Rieger\u2019s journey as he battles both internal demons and external threats. Prepare for dark twists, deeply personal moments, and decisions that carry real weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/fc12ba90fcd6701fcf22b4efb902d76c.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/a5d500de51895f73d3a3a3ec4cf0b53e.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the core storyline remains the same, the way you reach the end is entirely shaped by your choices. You may unlock \u2013 or miss \u2013 different environments: a city apartment, an industrial complex, a remote trailer, an abandoned village\u2026 Each map offers unique challenges, NPCs, and side missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/ab842817e14d44ce8a56d34ce621a249.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/ed8b22543803cb899eaed1b56849f41b.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At critical points, you\u2019ll be faced with hard decisions. These aren\u2019t simple right-or-wrong choices \u2013 they revolve around survival, trust, and sacrifice. Some consequences are immediate, others unfold much later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/6f379bae562867b83ceed0e4037fe79a.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/62187500bae5177c46f1daa6a81487f8.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is crafted for stealth, environmental storytelling, and resourceful progression. Rather than direct combat, tension arises from escape, evasion, and creative problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/953c795643e662e4efd1570a36dd6ccc.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/355975d1ea7a1d45ac1e9cb727742104.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized visual approach emphasizes rain, light, shadow, and desolate scenery to build an immersive, film-like mood. Complemented by ambient sound design and reactive music, the world pulls you in completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/eae133b1662fd85515f7776e75e2abab.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide Nick on his journey. Experience the story. Survive the consequences.</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/18d855f4e20e1a9d8a63bfe67b422c8a.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Mile</strong> is a gripping, story-driven action adventure where you step into the shoes of <strong>Nick Rieger</strong>, a man on the run from a dark past and relentless justice. But this is not just a tale of escape \u2013 it\u2019s a test of who you become when everything else is stripped away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blending a cinematic narrative with dynamic world progression, <i>The Last Mile</i> challenges players to navigate branching paths, shifting situations, and optional side quests based on their decisions.<br><strong>Same story \u2013 different journey.</strong> Every choice affects who you meet, what you experience, and how far you\u2019re willing to go to survive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/8452d5e53d2e3c3f8efe39e401d4d814.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Last Mile</i> explores themes of emotion, betrayal, humanity, and moral conflict. Follow Nick Rieger\u2019s journey as he battles both internal demons and external threats. Prepare for dark twists, deeply personal moments, and decisions that carry real weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/fc12ba90fcd6701fcf22b4efb902d76c.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/a5d500de51895f73d3a3a3ec4cf0b53e.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the core storyline remains the same, the way you reach the end is entirely shaped by your choices. You may unlock \u2013 or miss \u2013 different environments: a city apartment, an industrial complex, a remote trailer, an abandoned village\u2026 Each map offers unique challenges, NPCs, and side missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/ab842817e14d44ce8a56d34ce621a249.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/ed8b22543803cb899eaed1b56849f41b.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At critical points, you\u2019ll be faced with hard decisions. These aren\u2019t simple right-or-wrong choices \u2013 they revolve around survival, trust, and sacrifice. Some consequences are immediate, others unfold much later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/6f379bae562867b83ceed0e4037fe79a.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/62187500bae5177c46f1daa6a81487f8.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location is crafted for stealth, environmental storytelling, and resourceful progression. Rather than direct combat, tension arises from escape, evasion, and creative problem-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/953c795643e662e4efd1570a36dd6ccc.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/355975d1ea7a1d45ac1e9cb727742104.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=167 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A stylized visual approach emphasizes rain, light, shadow, and desolate scenery to build an immersive, film-like mood. Complemented by ambient sound design and reactive music, the world pulls you in completely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710580/extras/eae133b1662fd85515f7776e75e2abab.avif?t=1747986722\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guide Nick on his journey. Experience the story. Survive the consequences.</strong></h2>",
